<BaseLayout title="Privacy & Cookies — FourthWingDragon Fan Tools" description="How FourthWingDragon handles quiz answers, generated names, clipboard actions, cookies and links to external websites." breadcrumbs={[{name:'Privacy',href:'/privacy/'}]}><h1>Privacy and Cookies</h1><div class="prose"><p>This static website has no accounts, database or login. Quiz answers and generated names remain in the current browser tab. The site does not send them to a server or save them in local storage. Reloading clears quiz progress.</p><p>The quiz URL records the current step, without answers or a personal profile. Share as text and Copy name write to your clipboard only when you select those buttons. They do not post to social platforms.</p><p>The site uses Plausible Analytics, a privacy-focused statistics tool that does not identify individual visitors. It does not use advertising cookies or store personal profiles. Hosting infrastructure may process standard request logs. Google Search Console ownership is verified with a static HTML file.</p><p>External destinations and dictionary links follow their own privacy policies. Read those policies before submitting information there.</p></div></BaseLayout>
